The OCR model is not covered by the licence above either:

- mogi_tracker/model/rec.onnx (the scoreboard reader model) is by Nolanimations. It is not part of the source
  code and is not included in this repository.
- It is a fine-tuned version of the PP-OCRv4 Japanese text recognition model from PaddleOCR
  (https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR), copyright PaddlePaddle Authors, which is licensed under the Apache
  License 2.0 (see third_party/PaddleOCR-LICENSE.txt). The terms below cover the changes made by the fine-tuning
  and the model as a whole, they do not take away anyone's rights to the original PaddleOCR model.
- It is built into the official MKWorldMogiTracker.exe releases, and you may use it there, as part of the app.
- Please do not extract it from the app, copy it, redistribute or publish it, or use it in another project
  (including to train or fine-tune other models) without asking the author first.
- It can be requested from the author. If it is shared, it is on the condition that these terms are followed.

The typefaces of Mario Kart World were used to render the model's synthetic training images. No font data
is part of the model or of this software, and no rights to those typefaces are claimed. They belong to their
owners.

The character list (dict) is covered by the licence above.
